    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "summary",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. Summary"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Let's summarize: In-place prefix sum modifies the input array directly. It optimizes the space complexity from O(N) down to O(1) auxiliary space, while keeping the time complexity at O(N). Start the loop at index 1 to avoid bounds check errors, and only use this method if you do not need the original array values later!"
